    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruby and the Lost Crystals</strong> is a calm third-person puzzle adventure where you swap between two characters with unique abilities to solve magical puzzles, activate mechanisms, and explore the ruins of a forgotten civilisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/19cb966126ff556244100aea87d89bf3.avif?t=1753009084\" width=800 height=426 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae A solo adventure with dual-character gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruby</strong>, a young girl who can physically interact with the environment: push blocks, turn capstan, activate pressure plate and jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sapphire, </strong>a magical stone fairy who shoots projectiles to illuminate crystals, activate platforms, and swap the positions of objects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between the two to solve puzzles combining <strong>logic, spatial reasoning, timing, and magical interactions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/914740cd4a62d06a07645c8cc69e0e57.poster.avif?t=1753009084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/914740cd4a62d06a07645c8cc69e0e57.webm?t=1753009084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/914740cd4a62d06a07645c8cc69e0e57.mp4?t=1753009084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Evolving and varied puzzle mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area introduces <strong>new mechanics</strong>, combined in creative ways as the game progresses:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illuminate</strong> lost crystals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redirect and\u00a0<strong>combine coloured lasers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleport objects</strong> to create paths and platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move</strong> <strong>blocks</strong> and <strong>platforms</strong> to reach new areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact</strong> with pressure plates, rotatable structures, or long-range triggers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are handcrafted to <strong>challenge your thinking without ever overwhelming</strong>, encouraging experimentation and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/e9616314ff792eafdfa3f78b7531fd38.avif?t=1753009084\" width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This peaceful third-person puzzle adventure invites players to explore two handcrafted zones filled with ancient ruins, magical devices, and hidden secrets. Through a blend of light dialogue, stylised visuals, and an evolving original soundtrack, the game offers a calm and focused solo experience built around thoughtful interactions and the cooperation between two unique characters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/0320ea6fe3db85cb2807ce5a10ef412a.avif?t=1753009084\" width=800 height=426 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruby and the Lost Crystals</strong> is a calm third-person puzzle adventure where you swap between two characters with unique abilities to solve magical puzzles, activate mechanisms, and explore the ruins of a forgotten civilisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/19cb966126ff556244100aea87d89bf3.avif?t=1753009084\" width=800 height=426 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae A solo adventure with dual-character gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruby</strong>, a young girl who can physically interact with the environment: push blocks, turn capstan, activate pressure plate and jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sapphire, </strong>a magical stone fairy who shoots projectiles to illuminate crystals, activate platforms, and swap the positions of objects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between the two to solve puzzles combining <strong>logic, spatial reasoning, timing, and magical interactions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/914740cd4a62d06a07645c8cc69e0e57.poster.avif?t=1753009084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/914740cd4a62d06a07645c8cc69e0e57.webm?t=1753009084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/914740cd4a62d06a07645c8cc69e0e57.mp4?t=1753009084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Evolving and varied puzzle mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area introduces <strong>new mechanics</strong>, combined in creative ways as the game progresses:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illuminate</strong> lost crystals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redirect and\u00a0<strong>combine coloured lasers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleport objects</strong> to create paths and platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move</strong> <strong>blocks</strong> and <strong>platforms</strong> to reach new areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact</strong> with pressure plates, rotatable structures, or long-range triggers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are handcrafted to <strong>challenge your thinking without ever overwhelming</strong>, encouraging experimentation and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/e9616314ff792eafdfa3f78b7531fd38.avif?t=1753009084\" width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This peaceful third-person puzzle adventure invites players to explore two handcrafted zones filled with ancient ruins, magical devices, and hidden secrets. Through a blend of light dialogue, stylised visuals, and an evolving original soundtrack, the game offers a calm and focused solo experience built around thoughtful interactions and the cooperation between two unique characters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807810/extras/0320ea6fe3db85cb2807ce5a10ef412a.avif?t=1753009084\" width=800 height=426 /></span></p>",
